<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA in New York has issued 10 million American-style call and put warrants, in 10 equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Citibank (Switzerland) said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	10.JUN.98		 PAYDATE	05.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE  STRIKE     PRICE	 PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL  $740	 12.22 CHF   10.5 PCT    8.0 X</p>
<p> PUT   $740	 5.53  CHF   11.45 PCT   17.6 X</p>
<p> CALL  $760	 9.84  CHF   10.80 PCT   9.9 X</p>
<p> PUT   $760	 5.71  CHF   9.10 PCT    17.1 X</p>
<p> CALL  $780	 8.56  CHF   12.10 PCT   11.4 X</p>
<p> PUT   $780	 7.02  CHF   8.70 PCT    13.9 X</p>
<p> CALL  $800	 7.41  CHF   13.60 PCT   13.2 X</p>
<p> PUT   $800	 8.51  CHF   8.60 PCT    11.5 X</p>
<p> CALL  $820	 6.35  CHF   15.10 PCT   15.4 X</p>
<p> PUT   $820	 10.17 CHF   8.80 PCT    9.6  X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
